@startuml Hinh_2_7_Kien_truc_Event_Driven_Kafka
title Hình 2.7 – Kiến trúc Event-Driven với Apache Kafka
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Client Layer" {
  [Web App\nReact + Vite] as Web
  [Mobile App\nExpo React Native] as Mobile
}

package "Backend API (Spring Boot :8080)" {
  [TransactionService] as TxSvc
  [CryptoTransactionController] as CryptoCtrl
  [TransactionEventPublisher] as Publisher
  [NotificationConsumer] as NotifConsumer
  [AiInsightService] as AiSync
}

queue "Apache Kafka" as Kafka {
  frame "Topic: wallet.transactions" as Topic
}

package "AI Microservice (FastAPI :8000)" {
  [Kafka Consumer\nkafka_consumer.py] as AiConsumer
  [FraudDetector] as Fraud
  [SpendingAnalyzer] as Spend
  database "SQLite\nai.db" as AiDB
}

package "External" {
  [PostgreSQL] as PG
  [Web Push / UI] as Notify
}

Web --> TxSvc : REST API
Mobile --> TxSvc : REST API
Web --> CryptoCtrl : REST API

TxSvc --> PG : Ghi Transaction + Ledger
CryptoCtrl --> PG : Ghi CryptoTransaction

TxSvc --> Publisher : publish(TransactionEvent)
CryptoCtrl --> Publisher : publish(TransactionEvent)
Publisher --> Topic : JSON event\n(userId, type, amount, ...)

Topic --> AiConsumer : consume
AiConsumer --> AiDB : ingest transaction
AiConsumer --> Fraud : risk_score()
AiConsumer --> Spend : analyze()

Topic --> NotifConsumer : consume
NotifConsumer --> Notify : Cảnh báo / thông báo

AiSync ..> AiConsumer : HTTP fallback sync\n(/ingest)

note bottom of Topic
  Event-driven: tách ghi sổ (sync) và phân tích AI (async)
  Giảm độ trễ API, scale consumer độc lập
end note

@enduml
